  - id: n_ticket_intro
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: n_menu
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Tanaka
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_1
    textJa: "この店は、先に券売機で、券を買います。メニューは、これです。"
    textReading: "このみせは、さきにけんばいきで、けんをかいます。メニューは、これです。"
    textVi: "Quán này phải mua vé ở máy bán vé trước. Thực đơn đây này."
    textEn: "Here you buy a ticket at the ticket machine first. Here's the menu."
    textRomaji: "Kono mise wa, saki ni kenbaiki de, ken wo kaimasu. Menyuu wa, kore desu."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: point
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    flagCondition: 
    flagJumpNodeId: 
    targetItemId: 
    targetNpcId: 
