    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: Tanaka
    speakerId: npc_neighbor_1
    textJa: "みそは九百円、ぎょうざは四百円。九百と四百で、千三百円ですよ。"
    textReading: "みそはきゅうひゃくえん、ぎょうざはよんひゃくえん。きゅうひゃくとよんひゃくで、せんさんびゃくえんですよ。"
    textVi: "Miso 900 yên, gyoza 400 yên. 900 cộng 400 là 1.300 yên đấy."
    textEn: "Miso is 900 yen, gyoza is 400 yen. 900 plus 400 is 1,300 yen."
    textRomaji: "Miso wa kyuuhyaku en, gyouza wa yonhyaku en. Kyuuhyaku to yonhyaku de, sen sanbyaku en desu yo."
    textEnglishIpa: 
    animationCue: point
